They're about to go to the warehouse and hook up.

1291
00:58:00.360 --> 00:58:00.580
Right.

1292
00:58:00.780 --> 00:58:01.160
Exactly.

1293
00:58:02.000 --> 00:58:02.440
Exactly.

1294
00:58:02.760 --> 00:58:04.040
That's about to happen.

1295
00:58:04.480 --> 00:58:07.640
Well, back at the golf course, turns out Kevin did okay.

1296
00:58:07.760 --> 00:58:11.240
He wants to collect his money from all of his winnings.

1297
00:58:11.320 --> 00:58:13.180
But Mr. McGuire says, no, no, no.

1298
00:58:13.240 --> 00:58:16.000
We'll start a tab because I'm going to play more golf with you guys.

1299
00:58:16.470 --> 00:58:16.720
Hmm.

1300
