And while the guys are drinking beers, Angela shushes them.

1366
01:01:20.680 --> 01:01:25.880
And then Angela and Dwight have their moment later in the script when they leave and Dwight

1367
01:01:25.880 --> 01:01:27.140
holds open the door and all that.

1368
01:01:27.300 --> 01:01:31.980
But how awkward would it have been for Dwight and Angela to be there too?

1369
